        <label>deep sleeper (ambien)</label>
        <labelNoun>a deep sleeper</labelNoun>
        <description>The sedative properties of Ambien have successfully overwhelmed the active body stimulants, satisfying the conditions for deep sleep. When a pawn with this status rests in a bed or sleeping spot, they will smoothly transition into the restorative deep sleep phase. If the pawn's stimulation was too high, this state will fail to trigger.</description>
